# SecureFlow – Authentication System

SecureFlow is a simple and secure authentication web application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

This project includes Login and Registration functionality with a protected dashboard interface.

---

## 🚀 Features

- User Registration
- User Login
- Secure Session Handling
- Protected Dashboard
- Logout Functionality
- LocalStorage User Data
- SessionStorage Authentication
- Responsive UI Design
- Form Validation
- Error & Success Messages

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

